# Typing before anything has the caret, as in a window that has just
# opened, goes to the end of the document, as Typora's does.
write @DIR@/doc.md # Head\n\nSecond paragraph.\n
cmd openPath @DIR@/doc.md
wait 300
eval view.currentRow = -1
eval view.forceActiveFocus()
check view.currentRow === -1
type abc\nnew
check view.currentRow === 2
dump @OUT@
